{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act12side_level_act12side_05_end",
  "groupId": "act12side",
  "stageId": "act12side_05",
  "title": "曲徑求勝",
  "storyCode": "DH-5",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act12side/level_act12side_05_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "f81927f530fab8bca96c0aa77eec77136a48530400cd1ed24b4ec0f073b8b91c",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎麼辦，鼠膽龍威隊遭到了官方設置的伏兵的圍堵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "混戰之中，埃內斯托小弟選擇了殿後，而接過他鑰匙的兩位女俠則繼續向前。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "埃內斯托小弟雖然戰鬥力同樣不俗，但是敵人如此眾多，落敗也只是時間問題！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而反觀兩位女俠這邊，雖然突破了包圍圈，但是前方依然有伏兵，她們真的能夠順利逃脫嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哦？她們打開了路邊一家店的門然後衝了進去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這家店......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是埃內斯托開的店。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "原來如此，看來埃內斯托小弟丟給兩位女俠的鑰匙就是讓她們躲入自己的店中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是，這樣真的有效嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等等，導播，切一下鏡頭！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "原來如此，從另一角度看過去就明白了，這家店是有後門的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而我們可以看到，後門有一條直通大道的小路，而這條路還沒有被其他阻攔者發現！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這會是鼠膽龍威隊的機會嗎，還是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "D.D.D.的話音未落，螢幕中，埃內斯托的武器店就發出巨大的爆炸聲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這、這這這究竟是什麼情況？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "坎黛拉女士，這也是您設置的障礙嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果我要設置，那就不是只炸這一家店這麼簡單了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這......難道是其他隊伍知道埃內斯托小弟有這樣的後手而設下的陷阱？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果是這樣，那鼠膽龍威隊這一次可以說是被徹底算計了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "鼠膽龍威隊，難道要折戟於此了嗎！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_190_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好過分......陳小姐和林小姐不會有事吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "放心，她們兩個都是老江湖，這點爆炸死不了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只不過嘛......雖然這種比賽耍手段不奇怪，但這也有點太針對了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "老陳這是和誰結梁子了嗎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伏兵A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_194",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......嘖，這傢伙，怎麼回事，根本打不著他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "水月",
      "speakerToken": "avg_437_mizuki_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咦......那邊好像是陳姐姐她們去的方向。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "水月",
      "speakerToken": "avg_437_mizuki_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還是過去看一看吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "陳暉潔，你沒死吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1013_spchen_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咳，咳，死不了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒死就好。你的車呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你的呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看來，對方也沒想要置我們於死地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只不過......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "湊巧，出口被堵住了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1013_spchen_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好一個湊巧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你怎麼看？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "想辦法出去，還能怎麼看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_196_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我是問，誰幹的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1013_spchen_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我們的直覺看來沒錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_196_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯。埃內斯托看起來忍不住了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_196_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是你不覺得有些奇怪嗎？如果我是他，我不會這麼做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_196_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只有走投無路的人會用這種自爆式的方法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "要嘛，確實不是他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不可能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "要嘛，他想讓我們以為他走投無路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_196_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "林雨霞挑了挑眉毛，沒有接話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "對了，你把這件事告訴坎黛拉女士了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "當然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她怎麼說？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1013_spchen_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您不會做任何事......嗎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒錯，陳世侄，你是個聰明人，你應該想得到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "現在我派人去排查炸彈的話，不是等於在告訴幕後黑手我發現了他的陰謀嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1013_spchen_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒關係，陳世侄，你和林世侄已經做得很好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "老實說，我一開始根本沒有期待你們真的能查出什麼，哈哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您好像一點都不擔心？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "當然，陳世侄。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你也不用太關心這件事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我看你和林世侄在大獎賽裡也表現得很好，與其去想這些，不如努努力把第一拿下來，這樣魏彥吾臉上也有光嘛，哈哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1013_spchen_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們會考慮的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1013_spchen_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你應該想像得到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "確實。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "比起這個，怎麼出去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_196_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "聽說特別督察組組長在出任務的時候，一怒之下能把房子切成塊，讓我見識一下？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......不是所有的房子都能那麼切。這座房子明顯用了非常堅硬的材質。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你使沙子的能力能不能搬運一下？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我又不是我爸，這個堵塞程度，用我的能力也要花一些時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1013_spchen_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那還是我來試試。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不用。我有別的方法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1013_spchen_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "什麼方法？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_196_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你猜這是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1013_spchen_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......炸彈？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_196_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還記得我在第一輪找到的炸彈嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_196_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "雖然沒有辦法讓坎黛拉女士大規模地去搜查，但是我讓我在這邊收下的小弟裝成小偷去居民區盡可能地偷了一些出來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1013_spchen_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小偷？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_196_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小偷。只要稍微賄賂一下守衛，進去不鬧太大動靜，沒人會管你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1013_spchen_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1013_spchen_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "林雨霞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "幹什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1013_spchen_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "雖然道不同，但我過去一向敬重你與林先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1013_spchen_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "貧民窟沒有你們撐不下去，這我還是知道的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_196_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以呢？"
